          {
            "title": "Intro",
            "id": 89140,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Saat kita ingin memastikan bahwa sebuah kumpulan nilai tidak memiliki duplikat, kita menyimpannya dalam <strong>set</strong>, seperti kode pos berikut.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"postcodes = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;SW1A&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;SY3&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;B44&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(postcodes)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"34\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"{'SW1A', 'SY3', 'B44'}\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>{\"SW1A\", \"SY3\", \"B44\"}</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Set menyimpan value tanpa duplikat. Kelilingi value-nya dengan kurung kurawal <code>{}</code>. Simpan kode pos dalam set.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"postcodes = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;SW1A&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;SY3&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;B44&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(postcodes)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"34\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"[&quot;SW1A&quot;, &quot;SY3&quot;, &quot;B44&quot;]\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>{\"SW1A\", \"SY3\", \"B44\"}</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Intro 2",
            "id": 89375,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Set seperti <code>postcodes</code> adalah kumpulan nilai seperti list, tetapi tidak mengizinkan nilai duplikat.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"postcodes = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;SW1A&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;SY3&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;B44&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(postcodes)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"9\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>postcodes</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Set adalah kumpulan seperti list, tetapi menghapus duplikat. Beri nama variabel yang menyimpan set ini agar pernyataan print berfungsi.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"postcodes = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;SW1A&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;SY3&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;B44&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(postcodes)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"9\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"postcode\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>postcodes</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
